  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thig1.3" class="h1">Thig 1:3  Puṇṇā</h4>
          <div class="verse">
            <p>Puṇṇā, grow full with good qualities</p>
            <p>like the moon on the fifteenth day.</p>
            <p>With discernment at total fullness, burst</p>
            <p class="v2">the mass</p>
            <p class="v2">of darkness.</p>
          </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
